801 0 obj
<</ActualText(Flowchart illustrating a system for brain data analysis and real-time music generation. The top section shows post-hoc analysis using nirsLAB for data classification, including Python training. The bottom section details the real-time system, starting with an fNIRS device sending data to Aurora NIRS software, processed by MATLAB. Outputs control Ableton Live, generating drum patterns with Google Magenta using MIDI files. This audio is integrated with Unity Game Engine for real-time interaction. Various communication protocols like LSL, OSC, and ASCII are used throughout.)/A 803 0 R/K 0/P 780 0 R/S/Figure/T()/Pg 569 0 R/Alt(Flowchart illustrating a system for brain data analysis and real-time music generation. The top section shows post-hoc analysis using nirsLAB for data classification, including Python training. The bottom section details the real-time system, starting with an fNIRS device sending data to Aurora NIRS software, processed by MATLAB. Outputs control Ableton Live, generating drum patterns with Google Magenta using MIDI files. This audio is integrated with Unity Game Engine for real-time interaction. Various communication protocols like LSL, OSC, and ASCII are used throughout.)>>
endobj

