<</ActualText(3D brain model highlighting a red area on the left side, with a corresponding 2D top-down image on the right showing the same red area. Both visuals include a color scale from blue to red indicating data range from negative three to three, with a p-value threshold of 0.05.)/A 818 0 R/K 0/P 780 0 R/S/Figure/T()/Pg 629 0 R/Alt(3D brain model highlighting a red area on the left side, with a corresponding 2D top-down image on the right showing the same red area. Both visuals include a color scale from blue to red indicating data range from negative three to three, with a p-value threshold of 0.05.)>>
