820 0 obj
<</ActualText(Three brain activity maps titled ``Thresholded SPM{t} Image: p-value = 0.05 for Hbred'' show differences in activity under three conditions: Randomly Generated, Musical, and Metronome. The maps display colored regions indicating varying activity levels, with color bars underneath showing scales from negative to positive. The bottom section illustrates temporal event patterns for each condition with red and orange dashes on a blue arrow.)/A 821 0 R/K 1/P 780 0 R/S/Figure/T()/Pg 629 0 R/Alt(Three brain activity maps titled ``Thresholded SPM{t} Image: p-value = 0.05 for Hbred'' show differences in activity under three conditions: Randomly Generated, Musical, and Metronome. The maps display colored regions indicating varying activity levels, with color bars underneath showing scales from negative to positive. The bottom section illustrates temporal event patterns for each condition with red and orange dashes on a blue arrow.)>>
endobj

